profile_id (Integer)
profile_name (String) (join từ bảng group_profile).
group_code (String): Cột group_code.
group_name (String): Cột group_name.
master_account_id (Integer): Cột master_account_id.
created_by (Integer): Cột created_by.
created_at (String): Cột created_at.
total_elements (Integer)
POST /api/v1/admin/customer-groups - Tạo Nhóm khách hàng mới:
Request (Header): Authorization: Bearer <Token>
Request (Body):
profile_id (Integer)
group_code (String)
group_name (String)
created_by (Integer)
Response (201 Created):
status (String): "success".
message (String): "Thành công".
PUT /api/v1/admin/customer-groups/{id} - Cập nhật Nhóm khách hàng:
Request (Header): Authorization: Bearer <Token>
Request (Path Variable): id (Integer).
Request (Body):
profile_id (Integer)
group_code (String)
group_name (String)
master_account_id (Integer)
created_by (Integer)
Response (200 OK):
status (String): "success".
DELETE /api/v1/admin/customer-groups/{id} - Xóa Nhóm khách hàng:
Request (Header): Authorization: Bearer <Token>
Request (Path Variable): id (Integer).
Response (200 OK):
status (String): "success".

GET /api/v1/admin/customers - Lấy danh sách Khách hàng lẻ: (Bảng Customers)
Request (Header): Authorization: Bearer <Token>
Request (Query Params):
page (Integer)
size (Integer)
search (String): Tìm theo full_name hoặc phone.
group_id (Integer): Lọc theo group_id.
Response (200 OK):
status (String): "success".
data (Object - Phân trang):
content (Array):
id (Integer)
account_id (Integer)
group_id (Integer)
full_name (String)
phone (String) (join từ bản account)
created_at (String):
total_elements (Integer)
POST /api/v1/admin/customers - Tạo Khách hàng mới:
Request (Header): Authorization: Bearer <Token>
Request (Body):
group_id (Integer)
full_name (String)
phone (String)
address (String)
password (String) (Optional - cho trường hợp (admin tạo tài khoản luôn cho customer)
Response (201 Created):
status (String): "success".
message (String): "Thành công".
PUT /api/v1/admin/customers/{id} - Cập nhật Khách hàng:
Request (Header): Authorization: Bearer <Token>
Request (Path Variable): id (Integer).
Request (Body): 
account_id (Integer)
group_id (Integer)
full_name (String)
phone (String)
address (String)
Response (200 OK):
status (String): "success".
DELETE /api/v1/admin/customers/{id} - Xóa Khách hàng:
Request (Header): Authorization: Bearer <Token>
Request (Path Variable): id (Integer).
Response (200 OK):
status (String): "success".

