Request (Path Variable): id (Integer).
Request (Body):
max_quantity (Integer)
Response (200 OK):
status (String): "success".
DELETE /api/v1/admin/package-vehicle-types/{id} - Xóa hạn mức:
Request (Header): Authorization: Bearer <Token>
Request (Path Variable): id (Integer).
Response (200 OK):
