duration_months (Integer)
price (Double/BigDecimal)
is_active (Boolean)
Response (201 Created):
status (String): "success".
PUT /api/v1/admin/package-prices/{id} - Cập nhật mức giá:
Request (Header): Authorization: Bearer <Token>
Request (Path Variable): id (Integer).
Request (Body):
price (Double/BigDecimal)
is_active (Boolean)
Response (200 OK):
status (String): "success".
DELETE /api/v1/admin/package-prices/{id} - Xóa mốc giá:
Request (Header): Authorization: Bearer <Token>
Request (Path Variable): id (Integer).
Response (200 OK):
status (String): "success".

GET /api/v1/admin/tariff-rules - Lấy danh sách Công thức tính tiền: (Bảng Tariff_Rules)
Request (Header): Authorization: Bearer <Token>
