day_type (String)
start_time (String)
end_time (String)
base_price (Double)
is_active (Boolean): Cột is_active.
POST /api/v1/admin/tariff-rules - Tạo công thức mới:
Request (Header): Authorization: Bearer <Token>
Request (Body):
vehicle_type_id (Integer)
day_type (String)
start_time (String)
end_time (String)
base_price (Double)
is_active (Boolean)
