Request (Header): Authorization: Bearer <Token>
Request (Path Variable): id (Integer).
Request (Body): 
vehicle_type_id (Integer)
day_type (String)
start_time (String)
end_time (String)
base_price (Double)
is_active (Boolean)
Response (200 OK):
